# Quality Gate

Never report a coding task as complete immediately after writing code.

Run relevant validation.

Backend:

ruff check .
mypy app
pytest

Frontend:

npm run lint
npm run test -- --run
npm run build

UI functionality:

verify the primary user flow using Playwright.

Docker:

docker compose config --quiet

If any command fails:

investigate it

fix the problem

run the check again

Do not silently ignore failing tests.

Do not delete or weaken tests merely to make the suite pass.